[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 605.99, "timestamp": "00:10:05", "text": "串流媒體PC部分。  遊戲電腦壞了，所以沒關係。嗯，是的，[清嗓子]而且我們還在 Twitch 和 YouTube 上推出了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 607.59, "timestamp": "00:10:07", "text": "24 小時頻道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 613.59, "timestamp": "00:10:13", "text": "。呃，我宣布過，我會把我的V頻道改成"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 624.323, "timestamp": "00:10:24", "author": "@kurunekodream", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/RLzqgZjl8ILhIIU27ghgxtcyxaMDaQ4nJQ8GzPmDKVVI7HHPJUZsDQV_Itc49vlXGx8THQhiP90=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "what is a 24/7 channel? educate me"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 625.03, "timestamp": "00:10:25", "text": "24小時全天候的頻道，因為我現在很少用那個頻道了。所以，我想，好吧，你知道嗎？我至少會這樣用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 631.11, "timestamp": "00:10:31", "text": "所以，如果你太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 635.03, "timestamp": "00:10:35", "text": "想念我了，如果你願意的話，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 639.509, "timestamp": "00:10:39", "text": "你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 643.03, "timestamp": "00:10:43", "text": "觀看24小時頻道。它會在那裡。我的所有對戰都將進行，比賽結果將隨機分配。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 647.91, "timestamp": "00:10:47", "text": "，如果你來自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 651.75, "timestamp": "00:10:51", "text": "無法造訪 YouTube 或 Twitch 的國家或地區，你也可以直接從我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 654.23, "timestamp": "00:10:54", "text": "網站觀看。  呃，但是很遺憾，像比利比利或中國的人，由於"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 658.23, "timestamp": "00:10:58", "text": "YouTube 的地理限制，即使透過我的網站也無法"}]